  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_verdure_cbb9bd15ad98fcd0bd4a7fbab4ca4e42cfa3cf1b539e331e56edb9b64260053f4f">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a rich tapestry ornamented with representations of trees and other vegetation (OED s.v. verdure), here made of (or decorated with) caddis (OED caddis n.1) | a rich tapestry ornamented with representations of trees and other vegetation (OED 2, s.v. verdure) | a rich tapestry ornamented with representations of trees and other vegetation (OED 2, s.v. verdure), here of low quality | verdure, a rich tapestry ornamented with representations of trees and other vegetation (OED 2, s.v. verdure) | a rich tapestry ornamented with representations of trees and other vegetation (OED s.v. verdure) | a rich tapestry ornamented with representations of trees and other vegetation (OED s.v. verdure), here of low quality | banker, a covering, generally of tapestry, for a bench or a chair (OED s.v. banker1), her made of verdure</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
